---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const post = { title: 'Used Carton Boxes for Charity Drives, NGOs & Food Banks — Affordable Bulk Supply Malaysia', description: 'Budget-conscious used carton boxes for charity organisations, NGO collection drives, food banks, and zakat distribution centres. Bulk supply from Quinocycle Balakong with NGO-friendly pricing.', date: '2026-04-28', readTime: '7 min', category: 'Used Carton Boxes', author: 'Quinocycle Team', slug: 'used-carton-boxes-charity-donation-drives-0428' };
const WA_LINK = 'https://wa.me/60168916381?text=Hi%20Quinocycle!%20I%20need%20used%20carton%20boxes%20for%20a%20charity%20donation%20drive.';
const articleSchema = { "@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article", headline: post.title, description: post.description, datePublished: '2026-04-28', dateModified: '2026-04-28', inLanguage:"en-MY", author:{name:"Quinocycle Team",url:"https://www.quinocycle.com.my"}, publisher:{name:"Quinocycle Sdn. Bhd.",logo:{url:"https://www.quinocycle.com.my/logo.png"}}, mainEntityOfPage:{url:"https://www.quinocycle.com.my/blog/used-carton-boxes-charity-donation-drives-0428"}, keywords:"NGO packaging Malaysia, charity donation boxes Selangor, food bank carton supply, zakat packaging Balakong, used boxes bulk Malaysia, non-profit packaging Kajang" };
const faqSchema = { "@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"Do you offer NGO or charity discounts?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"We give a working discount on used cartons for registered NGOs, masjid charity wings, and verified food banks. Send your registration number via WhatsApp and we'll quote our charity rate. Some donations of mixed-grade cartons are also possible for larger drives."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What size used boxes work best for food bank distribution?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Medium 400x300x300mm cartons hit the sweet spot — large enough for a family food parcel (rice, oil, sugar, instant noodles, sardines) but light enough that a single volunteer can carry one. Bigger boxes get awkward and frequently split at the bottom seam."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Are used boxes hygienic enough for food parcels?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Our used cartons come from a single previous use — typically e-commerce shipping or factory inbound. They're clean and dry. For raw or unsealed food we recommend a fresh inner liner. For sealed packaged food (rice bags, canned goods) the cartons are perfectly suitable."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Can you deliver to a temporary collection point or event venue?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Yes. We deliver to community halls, masjid compounds, school carparks, and event venues across Klang Valley as long as we have access for our lorry. Tell us the access constraints and we'll plan around them."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What's the minimum order for charity rates?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Minimum order remains RM 1,000 even at charity pricing. Most drives clear this easily — used cartons start from RM 0.80 each, so 1,000 boxes is well above the minimum and gives you reserve stock for follow-up distributions."}}]};
const localBusinessSchema = { "@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Store", name:"Quinocycle Sdn. Bhd.", url:"https://www.quinocycle.com.my", telephone:"+60168916381", address:{streetAddress:"No.13, Jalan Taming P/1, Taming Jaya", addressLocality:"Balakong", addressRegion:"Selangor", postalCode:"43300", addressCountry:"MY"}, geo:{latitude:3.0579,longitude:101.7468}, openingHoursSpecification:[{dayOfWeek:["Monday","Tuesday","Wednesday","Thursday","Friday"],opens:"09:00",closes:"17:00"},{dayOfWeek:"Saturday",opens:"09:00",closes:"13:00"}], priceRange:"RM 1.90 – RM 6.50 per box", areaServed:"Peninsular Malaysia" };
---
<Layout title={post.title} description={post.description}>
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(articleSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(faqSchema)} />
  <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(localBusinessSchema)} />
  <article class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 md:px-8 pt-16 pb-24">
    <header class="mb-8">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-4">
        <span class="bg-primary/20 text-primary font-label font-bold text-xs uppercase tracking-widest px-3 py-1 rounded-full">{post.category}</span>
        <time class="font-body text-sm text-secondary">{post.date}</time>
      </div>
      <h1 class="font-headline text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tighter text-on-surface mb-4">{post.title}</h1>
      <p class="font-body text-lg text-secondary leading-relaxed">{post.description}</p>
    </header>

    <div class="prose prose-lg max-w-none">
      <section class="mb-12">
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Charity work runs on slim budgets. Every ringgit spent on packaging is a ringgit not spent on the rice, the textbooks, or the medicines you're trying to deliver. Used carton boxes are the obvious answer — they cost a third of new cartons, they're sturdy enough for sealed-goods distribution, and they extend a useful second life before the recycling stream. Quinocycle has supplied food banks, NGO collection drives, and zakat distribution centres across Klang Valley for years. Here's how to set up a charity-drive packaging plan that protects both your beneficiaries and your books.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Food Bank & Welfare Parcel Packaging</h2>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Standard Family Food Parcels</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">A typical Malaysian family food parcel contains 5kg rice, cooking oil, sugar, instant noodles, canned sardines, biscuits, and a few essentials — about 8–10kg total. A medium 400x300x300mm used carton handles this comfortably and is light enough for elderly recipients to carry into a flat. Stack 12–14 of these on a pallet for transport.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Bulk Donations from Corporate Sponsors</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">When a corporate sponsor drops 200kg of donated rice, you need bigger working boxes to consolidate, sort, and re-portion. Heavy-duty used double-wall cartons (often originating from import shipments) handle this without bowing, and they're far cheaper than buying new for a one-off drive.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Last-Mile Distribution to Beneficiary Homes</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Volunteers loading their own cars need cartons that fit through doorways and stack neatly in a boot. The medium-format cartons mentioned above are ideal. Avoid oversized boxes — they tip over in transit and embarrass the volunteer at delivery.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Disaster Relief & Emergency Drives</h2>
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Flood Relief Sundry Kits</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Flood-relief kits include towels, blankets, toiletries, drinking water, and dry rations. Used cartons keep these dry through the journey to evacuation centres in Kelantan, Pahang, and Selangor's flood-prone areas. Wax-coated or moisture-resistant used cartons (where available) survive overnight outdoor storage.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Clothing Donation Sorting & Distribution</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Clothing drives generate huge volumes of donations that need sorting by size, type, and condition. Used cartons let your volunteers create a fast sort line at almost zero cost. Mark each carton with masking tape — adult/kid, summer/cold, men/women — and you have an instant warehouse layout.</p>

        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Hygiene Kits for Refugees & Underserved Communities</h3>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Smaller cartons (250x200x150mm) packed with toothpaste, soap, sanitary pads, hand sanitiser, and tissues serve refugee communities in Selayang, Ampang, and the wider KL area. The smaller format respects the limited storage space of recipients living in shared accommodation.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Zakat & Religious Charity Distributions</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Many masjid charity wings run year-round zakat distributions plus seasonal Ramadan and Aidilfitri pushes. Used cartons keep the per-parcel cost low so that more of every donor's contribution reaches asnaf families. We've worked with masjid committees across Selangor to set up bulk repeat-orders timed to monthly distribution dates.</p>
      </section>

      <div class="bg-surface-variant/50 border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-8 my-12">
        <h3 class="font-headline text-xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Charity Drive Carton Sizing Guide</h3>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">FAMILY FOOD PARCEL</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">400x300x300mm | ~8–10kg capacity</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">BULK SORTING/CONSOLIDATION</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">600x400x400mm | Double-wall</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">HYGIENE KIT (INDIVIDUAL)</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">250x200x150mm | Light single-wall</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <p class="font-label text-primary font-bold text-sm mb-2">FLOOD RELIEF SUNDRIES</p>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm">450x350x350mm | Moisture-resistant</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <section class="mb-12">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-6">Charity & NGO FAQs</h2>
        <div class="space-y-4">
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Do you offer NGO or charity discounts?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — registered NGOs, masjid charity wings, and verified food banks get a working discount. Share your registration via WhatsApp and we'll quote.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What size used boxes work best for food bank distribution?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Medium 400x300x300mm hits the sweet spot — fits a family parcel, light enough for elderly recipients to carry.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Are used boxes hygienic enough for food parcels?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes for sealed packaged food. For raw or unsealed food, line the carton with fresh kraft paper.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">Can you deliver to a community hall or event venue?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">Yes — community halls, masjid compounds, school carparks across Klang Valley, as long as our lorry can access.</p>
          </details>
          <details class="group border border-outline-variant/20 rounded-lg p-4">
            <summary class="font-label font-bold text-on-surface cursor-pointer">What's the minimum order for charity rates?</summary>
            <p class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm mt-3 leading-relaxed">RM 1,000 minimum. Most drives clear this easily — used cartons from RM 0.80 each.</p>
          </details>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-12 bg-primary/5 border border-primary/20 rounded-lg p-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Packaging Support for Malaysian Charities</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-6">Quinocycle is proud to support charity work across Selangor and the wider Klang Valley with affordable used cartons, fast delivery, and flexible quantities.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface mb-6"><strong>Contact Quinocycle today:</strong></p>
        <ul class="font-body text-on-surface text-sm space-y-2 mb-6">
          <li>📞 <strong>Phone:</strong> +60 16 8916 381 / 03-8962 6381</li>
          <li>📧 <strong>Email:</strong> quinocycle@gmail.com</li>
          <li>📍 <strong>Address:</strong> No.13, Jalan Taming P/1, Taming Jaya, Balakong, Selangor 43300</li>
        </ul>
        <a href={WA_LINK} class="inline-block bg-primary text-on-primary font-label font-bold text-sm px-6 py-3 rounded-lg hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity">💬 Chat on WhatsApp</a>
      </section>

      <section class="mb-8">
        <h2 class="font-headline text-2xl font-bold text-on-surface mb-4">Conclusion: More Help Reaching More People</h2>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed mb-4">Used cartons are how charities stretch every donor ringgit further. The packaging quietly does its job and gets out of the way of the work that matters.</p>
        <p class="font-body text-on-surface leading-relaxed">If your charity, masjid, NGO, or food bank needs reliable, affordable carton supply in Klang Valley — talk to us. We'll quote our charity rate.</p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </article>
</Layout>
